## Static authority rationale

The helper reloads and compares the repository checkpoint before counting. It then reloads every projected experiment by its stored reference and requires equality with the projected record, a strictly prior round, the active discovery-plan identity, and the active PIT data scope and semantic mode. Any authority mismatch raises the specified `ValueError`; repository reload failures propagate. Only authenticated invalid records whose validation failure code is `policy_source_unbounded_or_stateful` contribute to the cumulative count.

